==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Pumpkin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Count Owlbrow]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 53.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~2,000f</sup>.
**10 [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

