==Strategy==
Stall for max wallet before hitting the base if needed. Count Owlbrow can be stalled like how you would with Owlbrow so you can deal with it later. Area and Wave Attackers can be used to deal with the peons, however stay on high alert with Zigges as its burrows can halt your defenses or be detrimental to the battle. After depleting the enemy population, Count Owlbrow can be taken out with chip damage or any Long Range Attackers.

